# Only what ships, and the source behind it, is tracked:
#   mod/esp, mod/pak, mod/ue4ss (Lua mods, the DLL and its src/), mod/unblivion (the Unblivion
#   edition's mod folder, as players install it), docs/release.
# Build tooling, extraction work and the investigation write-ups stay local.
.work/
dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tools/
docs/design/
docs/findings/
reddit-post.md
# The Unblivion edition's loose voice files are copies of the game's own recordings: they ship in the mod's
# release archive, never in this public repository.
mod/unblivion/Extended Races/Data/sound/
